flowchart TD
    A([pytest --site --target-env --exec-profile --case-id]) --> B[conftest.py<br/>registra plugins de fixtures/]
    B --> C[fixtures/execution_fixtures.py<br/>pytest_configure: valida sitio/ambiente]
    C --> D{¿Sitio y ambiente<br/>existen en sites.yaml?}
    D -- No --> E[[UnknownSiteError /<br/>UnknownEnvironmentError]]
    D -- Sí --> F[RunContext<br/>genera Run ID]
    F --> G[core/config<br/>config_loader + site_config]
    G --> H[ExecutionContext inmutable<br/>site, env, base_url, timeouts, run_id]
    H --> I[core/logging<br/>logs con run_id/site/env/case_id]
    H --> J[fixtures/browser_fixtures.py<br/>Playwright → Browser → Context → Page]
    H --> K[fixtures/data_fixtures.py<br/>DataProvider YAML / Excel]
    J --> L[fixtures/page_fixtures.py<br/>PageFactory por sitio]
    L --> M{Tipo de prueba}
    M -- architecture/unit --> N[tests/architecture · tests/unit<br/>sin navegador]
    M -- BDD --> O[test_cases/*.feature] --> P[tests/bdd/steps<br/>steps delgados]
    M -- smoke/regression --> Q[tests/smoke]
    P --> R[workflows/<br/>coordinación, sin locators]
    Q --> S
    R --> S[pages/ Page Objects<br/>+ components comunes]
    S --> T[*_locators.py<br/>solo selectores]
    S --> U((Sitio ecommerce<br/>MA · VIU · MAVI))
    K --> R
    R --> V[domain/ modelos<br/>Product · Cart · Order · Money]
    Q --> W{Asserts en el test}
    P --> W
    W --> X[core/evidence + repositories<br/>artifacts/runs/run_id · escritura atómica]
    X --> Y[core/reporting<br/>Allure: artifacts/allure-results]
    Y --> Z([Resultado normalizado → MAVI AI Bridge → Plane<br/>pendiente tarea posterior])
